# Harness boundary (Cursor overlay)

This machine-local overlay reinforces portable policy. Full text: [`general/harness-boundary.md`](general/harness-boundary.md).

- **Forkable templates** (`user.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `general/*`, `agents/*`, `skills/*`) — placeholders only; PR upstream.
- **Machine-local** — `$CODE_ROOT/harness.md`, `$CODE_ROOT/machine.md`, `%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\rules\*.mdc`.
- Before editing agent-rules templates, read `$CODE_ROOT/harness.md`. Missing setup → skill **`harness-setup`**.
